# 🖥️ МАШИНА 2: HQ-RTR (EcoRouterOS)

### Шаг 1. Вход и смена имени
```text
enable
configure terminal
hostname hq-rtr
ip domain-name <DOMAIN>
write memory
```

### Шаг 2. Проверка портов
```text
show port brief
```

### Шаг 3. Настройка интерфейса в сторону ISP
```text
configure terminal
interface isp
 description "ISP"
 ip address <IP-HQ-RTR-ISP>
 exit
port <HQ-RTR-ISP-IF>
 service-instance <HQ-RTR-ISP-IF>/isp
  encapsulation untagged
  connect ip interface isp
  exit
 exit
ip route 0.0.0.0/0 <GW-ISP-HQ>
write memory
```

### Шаг 4. Настройка VLAN-интерфейсов (100, 200, 999)
```text
configure terminal
interface v100
 description "VLAN 100"
 ip address <IP-HQ-RTR-V100>
 exit
interface v200
 description "VLAN 200"
 ip address <IP-HQ-RTR-V200>
 exit
interface v999
 description "VLAN 999"
 ip address <IP-HQ-RTR-V999>
 exit
write memory
```

### Шаг 5. Привязка VLAN к порту (в сторону HQ-SW)
```text
configure terminal
port <HQ-RTR-LAN-IF>
 service-instance <HQ-RTR-LAN-IF>/v100
  encapsulation dot1q 100 exact
  rewrite pop 1
  connect ip interface v100
  exit
 service-instance <HQ-RTR-LAN-IF>/v200
  encapsulation dot1q 200 exact
  rewrite pop 1
  connect ip interface v200
  exit
 service-instance <HQ-RTR-LAN-IF>/v999
  encapsulation dot1q 999 exact
  rewrite pop 1
  connect ip interface v999
  exit
 exit
write memory
```

### Шаг 6. Проверка IP-адресов
```text
show ip interface brief
show service-instance brief
```

### Шаг 7. Создание пользователя net_admin
```text
configure terminal
username net_admin
 password P@ssw0rd
 role admin
 exit
write memory
```

### Шаг 8. Создание GRE-туннеля
```text
configure terminal
interface tunnel.0
 description "GRE"
 ip address <TUN-HQ>
 ip tunnel <IP-HQ-RTR-ISP-без-префикса> <IP-BR-RTR-ISP-без-префикса> mode gre
 exit
write memory
```
**Проверка:**
```text
show interface tunnel.0
ping 10.10.10.2
```

### Шаг 9. Динамическая маршрутизация OSPF
```text
configure terminal
router ospf 1
 ospf router-id 10.10.10.1
 passive-interface default
 no passive-interface tunnel.0
 network 10.10.10.0/30 area 0
 network 192.168.100.0/27 area 0
 network 192.168.200.0/24 area 0
 network 192.168.99.0/29 area 0
 exit
interface tunnel.0
 ip ospf authentication message-digest
 ip ospf message-digest-key 1 md5 P@ssw0rd
 exit
write memory
```

### Шаг 10. Проверка OSPF
```text
show ip ospf neighbor
show ip route ospf
show ip ospf interface tunnel.0
```

### Шаг 11. Динамическая трансляция адресов (NAT)
```text
configure terminal
interface isp
 ip nat outside
 exit
interface v100
 ip nat inside
 exit
interface v200
 ip nat inside
 exit
interface v999
 ip nat inside
 exit
ip nat pool VLAN100 <IP-HQ-RTR-V100-без-префикса-минус-1>-<последний-адрес>
ip nat pool VLAN200 <IP-HQ-RTR-V200-без-префикса-минус-1>-<последний-адрес>
ip nat pool VLAN999 <IP-HQ-RTR-V999-без-префикса-минус-1>-<последний-адрес>
ip nat source dynamic inside-to-outside pool VLAN100 overload interface isp
ip nat source dynamic inside-to-outside pool VLAN200 overload interface isp
ip nat source dynamic inside-to-outside pool VLAN999 overload interface isp
write memory
```
**Проверка:**
```text
show ip nat translations
```

### Шаг 12. DHCP-сервер для HQ-CLI
```text
configure terminal
ip pool VLAN200 192.168.200.2-192.168.200.254
dhcp-server 1
 pool VLAN200 1
  mask 24
  gateway 192.168.200.1
  dns <DNS-HQ-SRV-без-префикса>
  domain-name <DOMAIN>
  exit
 exit
interface v200
 dhcp-server 1
 exit
write memory
```
**Проверка:**
```text
show running-config dhcp-server 1
show dhcp-server clients v200
```

### Шаг 13. Часовой пояс
```text
configure terminal
ntp timezone utc+3
write memory
show ntp timezone
```

### Шаг 14. Разрешение SSH для Ansible (если нужно)
```text
configure terminal
security none
write memory
```

